Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:06.36,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Junius7在移動？到底為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:11.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這還無從知曉 但的確在移動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:13.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,而且還已相當快的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:15.60,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,在最危險的軌道上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:18.00,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不可能改變軌道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:21.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,想避免相撞的話只有擊碎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:28.10,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,伏爾泰號和盧梭號攜帶隕石破壞器已經先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.08,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,嗯 我們也趕快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,據說那傢伙也去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:36.14,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,支援工作多一台也好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:40.26,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,因為人家能開MS嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:41.70,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:42.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:47.22,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但本艦的任務是支援玖爾隊這點沒變
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:50.48,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,換裝完成後各機出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:54.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,情況有變化了呢 很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:57.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不如作罷？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:00:59.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,別小看人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:06.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉 出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:21.58,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這些菜鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:29.22,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們意志不容動搖 事到如今
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.52,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.40,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,撤退 暫時撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:40.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,射出GuAIZ的萊複槍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:43.66,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,堤亞哥 護住隕石破壞器
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:45.26,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我也馬上出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:26.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這支部隊是使用GINN嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:29.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,嗯 似乎是高機動2型
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.02,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,附近有母艦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:32.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,沒有發現
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:34.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:39.14,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,改變Junius7軌道的就是他們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:42.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,到底是哪里的傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:50.26,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但這樣的話更不能讓它墜落地球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.48,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,也這樣告訴雷他們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:53.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:54.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:02:59.34,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.44,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你還不知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:07.58,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,他說也想幫忙作業
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:10.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在正在現場
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:48.72,Title SEED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(510,540)\pos(660,536)}世界終結之時
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:23.71,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,到底是些什麼人 GINN用得那麼熟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:29.45,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,工兵隊繼續進行破壞作業
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:31.99,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這樣正中他們下懷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:43.43,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑 在這裏胡鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:47.11,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,就是你們讓這東西動起來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:02.23,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,什麼 Chaos Gaia Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.61,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,是ArmoryOne被搶的機體嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:10.11,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,是那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.63,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那三台 這次絕不放過
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:15.79,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,目的不是戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:17.07,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.49,0:06:19.07,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但對方會打來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:21.81,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不幹掉他們也沒法作業
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:29.27,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Junius7降落角又增加1.5 加速4%
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:33.99,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,玖爾隊受到Chaos Gaia Abyss的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:37.17,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這樣沒法進行粉碎作業
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:39.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,艦長 本艦也攻擊BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:46.77,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,議長 現階段該對BogeyOne做何種判斷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:49.09,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,海盜？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:51.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,還是地球軍？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.11,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,很為難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:57.09,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我不想認定它為地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:01.67,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不知會播下怎樣的火種啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:18.59,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但情況變化了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:21.39,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,嗯 在這種非常時期
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:26.55,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,他們如果不自己承認隸屬或服從地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.89,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這場戰鬥毫無任何意義
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:46.15,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,反而可能會被誤解我們在保護那支GINN部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:47.27,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:48.47,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:53.95,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那些機體是Dagger的話你也會懷疑地球軍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:59.07,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,能和BogeyOne取得聯絡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:01.79,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,如果使用國際救難頻道的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:03.25,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那就用它呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:08.75,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說我們正為阻止Junius7墜落進行粉碎作業
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:23.93,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:34.75,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:50.19,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這傢伙是誰 厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.85,0:09:18.67,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,就此結束了 紅色的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.01,0:09:20.79,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:18.93,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我現在必須告知大家一件重要的事實
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.69,0:10:25.45,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,外部已經盛傳 Junius7偏離軌道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.93,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,正朝地球接近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:41.17,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們奧布政府也立即與其他各國政府討論對策
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:42.55,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但時間有限
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:47.87,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,非常遺憾的是 至今仍未討論出有效對策
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:54.05,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,到底為什麼 而且是以這種速度
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:56.65,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,關於這些仍不得而知
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:10:58.39,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,可能避免嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:01.99,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,到達的預定時間和現在測算出的墜落預定地點是？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:06.93,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在PLANT和聯合二軍正在全力進行粉碎作業
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:10.23,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們將立即宣佈緊急狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:13.65,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,讓國民迅速到防空洞內避難
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:15.25,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,來得及嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:17.11,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,粉碎成功的可能性呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:21.13,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,防空洞無法收容地球全部人口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:22.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:25.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,磨磨蹭蹭的就算碎開也來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,固定 完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:46.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.64,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Great 幹得好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:26.74,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:31.52,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.34,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,分兩半了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:38.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,得分得再碎一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:43.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:46.92,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你小子在這種地方幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:48.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,別管那麼多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:50.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在要加緊作業
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:57.02,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,還是老樣子 伊紮克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.04,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:13:59.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,真沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:31.68,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:38.32,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,伊紮克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:39.48,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:43.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,現在我是隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:44.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,別命令我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:47.38,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你這老百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:51.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:08.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那就是...雅金·多維戰中生還的機師的力量嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:17.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,真 在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:19.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,作業還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:22.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,就完了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:31.06,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,終於相信我們了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:33.30,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,或許是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,也可能有別的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:37.08,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,別的理由？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:38.54,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,是高度
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:44.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,若就這樣和Junius7一起降落下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:48.74,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,最終連艦船也無法逃脫地球引力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們也必須對生命做出選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:57.04,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,能救的人 和不能救的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:15:58.26,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:01.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這種情況下實非得已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:04.70,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,議長等人可否轉移去伏爾泰號
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.72,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,密涅瓦此後將突入大氣層
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:13.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,到達許可權前使用艦首炮粉碎物件
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:17.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,艦長 這...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.04,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,雖不知能做到何種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:25.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但若擁有相當的能力 卻坐視不理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:26.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,事後會不得心安的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:28.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,塔里婭 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:32.16,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我還算是個運氣不錯的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:33.66,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,請交給我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:36.92,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:38.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,對不起 塔里婭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:40.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:41.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.74,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,議長也請趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:45.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那麼 首相
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:49.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,通知伏爾泰號狄蘭達爾議長將來移乘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:51.24,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,給MS發返航信號
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:53.92,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我要留在這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:56.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭還沒回來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:01.10,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,而且 若密涅瓦要做到那個地步
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:02.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我也要一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:06.94,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但是 從政者應該還有其他工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.46,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,既然首相希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:11.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我不會阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:17.28,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,極限高度了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.78,0:17:23.00,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,密涅瓦打算一邊發射艦首炮一邊隨同降下？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:39.26,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,通告全員
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:43.32,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,本艦收容MS後 將突入大氣層
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,使用艦首炮進行碎片粉碎作業
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:48.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,各部門 參照說明
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:51.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,望迅速行動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:03.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:06.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,返航命令已經下達了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.28,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,應該也給你通訊了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:11.74,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我知道 你快點回去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.62,0:18:15.36,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,會被一起炸飛的 沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:17.76,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,就算是密涅瓦的艦首炮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:20.62,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,但從外部攻擊無法保證
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.36,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,哪怕只有這一個...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:29.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你這樣的人 為什麼會在奧布那種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:38.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不會再讓你們得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:41.68,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,這些傢伙還在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:53.80,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我女兒的墓碑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.88,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不落下就無法改變世界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:18:59.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,女兒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:01.12,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:06.04,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,忘記被無情粉碎的生命哀號
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.72,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,罪魁禍首為何還能在虛偽的世界發笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.82,0:19:10.82,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,你們這些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:16.84,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,被庫萊茵的繼承者們欺騙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:19.68,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,紮夫特已經變了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:43.18,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,為何還不醒悟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:47.60,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,對我們調整者來說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:52.08,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,巴特利葛·薩拉所走的道路才是唯一的正途
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:20.70,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:44.50,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,降落程式 Phase-2
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:48.08,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,Impulse和他的Zaku呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:51.16,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,不行 無法確認位置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:51.94,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:57.76,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,我們的意志 這次定要讓自然人們嘗嘗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:37.70,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,來 大家都過來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:40.06,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,跟著我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.56,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,怎麼 去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:44.72,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,知道了 去買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:46.98,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,還想玩呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:49.40,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,基拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.62,0:23:27.78,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,那是無法預知的慘劇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.34,0:23:31.90,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,昔日黑暗中傳來的聲音 火焰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:35.44,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,破碎 墜落之物才是和平嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.28,0:23:39.42,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,再次燃燒的大地上 基拉將...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:43.60,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,下回 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:45.58,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,迷亂的大地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.34,Default SEED,,0,0,0,,劈裂灼熱的大氣吧 Impulse
